    {
      "id": "claim_153b3e999617416e85060c946669efb0",
      "statement": "SyncMainAsync fast-forwards local main only for a non-deleted refs/heads/main: it fetches with prune, skips on a mirror problem, no-ops when already current, and otherwise merges --ff-only, swallowing InvalidOperationException and cancellation as warnings so a failed or slow sync never fails the caller.",
