      "id": "claim_53a33a77b53d4abbbf0a4dd5c4845bac",
      "statement": "FindMirrorProblemAsync is the single source of the three mirror guards and their operator-facing messages: local main must be the checked-out branch, must have no uncommitted tracked changes, and must not be ahead of origin/main; otherwise the returned string is thrown by workspace preparation and logged as a skip by sync.",
