      "statement": "Build and test are two separate compilations with no solution file: tests/** is excluded from the web project, which enforces TreatWarningsAsErrors, AnalysisLevel=latest-all, PublishAot and InvariantGlobalization while the xunit test project inherits none of them, so `dotnet test tests/Sebastian.Tests/Sebastian.Tests.csproj` passing does not prove analyzer or AOT cleanliness of product code.",
