      "statement": "Single-repository operation is enforced at three layers, not one: Program.cs registers one Git instance built from the host content root, Git.StartAsync throws unless that directory is the git toplevel and origin parses to an owner/repo, and PrepareWorkspaceAsync additionally throws when a job's issue repository does not match the local origin identity.",
