    {
      "id": "claim_9e7c2faa93a14224831bae500f1c0855",
      "statement": "The process has no ability to commit or push: Git's public surface is limited to inspection (rev-parse, branch, status, rev-list), fetch with prune, ff-only merge, worktree add/prune and status — with no commit or push command — the generated agent prompt forbids running git commands, committing, pushing, or creating pull requests, and the HTTP surface is only GET /health plus the webhook endpoint, so each agent run's product is uncommitted files in its worktree plus a log line.",
