    {
      "id": "claim_b7375296be3546eba06ab26158674c8a",
      "statement": "Intake both terminalizes and admits work: an issue failing spec validation is commented on and closed, an issue passing validation but lacking ready-for-agent produces no job and no Information-level log line, an accepted issue becomes an ImplementSpec whose TryAdd returning false is only a Debug-level 'already running' note, and a push event instead calls SyncMainAsync inline — so a delivery that 'did nothing' is the normal, silent outcome of several distinct gates.",
