    {
      "id": "claim_a9e75d38022947d1a4f8d4b26d1333a9",
      "statement": "Sebastian has no dashboard, no database, and no scheduler: the only durable state between deliveries is the git clone (including the untracked .sebastian/workspaces folder used for issue worktrees) plus what lives in GitHub (issues, labels, comments), while in-flight work exists only in the in-memory unbounded JobQueue channel.",
